    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "0ykeoxz",
      "content": "• Life is full of suffering (Dukkha)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "78n76qf",
      "content": "• Suffering is caused by desire."
    },
